# Fireglass Mentor: "if an opponent lost life this turn" - paying life counts as losing it (CR 119.4, 107.4f). In its own
# first main phase Bot1 casts a Mox, and Bot2 answers by casting Dismember at its own Llanowar Elves, paying 2 life for each
# {B/P} (20 -> 16). In Bot1's second main phase the Mentor triggers: Island and Mountain are exiled and Bot1 chooses the
# Mountain. On turn 1 no opponent had lost life, so nothing was exiled in that second main phase (negative control).

